if($('adminRefresh'))$('adminRefresh').onclick=loadAdminControl;if($('adminAiRefresh'))$('adminAiRefresh').onclick=()=>loadAdminAi();if($('systemDocsRefresh'))$('systemDocsRefresh').onclick=()=>loadSystemDocs(true);if($('adminReloadLog'))$('adminReloadLog').onclick=async()=>{state.processingLog=await api('api/v1/processing-log?limit=100');renderProcessingLog();renderAdminControl()};if($('adminPause'))$('adminPause').onclick=async()=>{await api('api/v1/admin/control',{method:'PUT',body:JSON.stringify({paused:!state.adminControl?.paused})});toast(state.adminControl?.paused?'Automatic updating resumed':'Automatic updating paused');await loadAdminControl()};if($('adminRunAll'))$('adminRunAll').onclick=()=>runAdminProcess('full_refresh',$('adminRunAll'));
